# Legal notice

## Nothing is bundled here

Yoru ships no third-party code, no fonts, no images and no audio. It is built
on Swing and the JDK alone, and every picture in its interface is drawn at
runtime. Music, Markdown and anything else you import stays yours and stays on
your machine.

